{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今晚（4日）播出的《三代同糖》劇情超展開，容天佑飾演的霸道總裁高冠一，竟淪為何依婷的「阿四」！他在戀愛節目中被 …</p><p></p>\n<p>今晚（4日）播出的《三代同糖》劇情超展開，容天佑飾演的霸道總裁高冠一，竟淪為何依婷的「阿四」！他在戀愛節目中被迫幫女友挽鞋，更在遊戲落敗後當眾潑沙兼爆粗，少爺仔脾氣大爆發，場面極度失控，究竟他與何依婷的關係會否因此亮起紅燈？\n</p>\n<h2>容天佑戀綜失控 潑沙爆粗勁失禮</h2>\n<p>在最新單元「少爺們的戀愛」中，高冠一（容天佑飾）為向前度的男友示威，一怒之下與女友朱圓圓（何依婷飾）參加戀愛綜藝節目。節目中他完全放下身段，不但要為何依婷拿行李，更要幫手挽高踭鞋，背後卻忍不住狂數對方：「一 Roll 機三分顏色上大紅，叫我拎完呢樣拎嗰樣，仲要我幫佢挽鞋！」其後在沙灘玩「三人扯大纜爭旗仔」遊戲時，因被對手聯手夾擊而落敗，他竟當場像小朋友般潑沙洩憤，再被前度（鍾晴飾）取笑是「軟腳蟹」後，更不顧鏡頭破口大罵，盡顯沉不住氣的少爺仔脾氣。</p>\n<h2>何依婷專業公關上身 急忙安撫解圍</h2>\n<p>面對男友容天佑在鏡頭前大發脾氣，飾演專業公關的何依婷即時上前溫柔安慰，努力化解現場的尷尬氣氛，表現專業。不過，滿腦子只想嫁入豪門的她，似乎未有察覺男友對她的種種不滿，事後只顧上網查看針對自己的負面留言，對二人的關係裂痕毫無警覺。這種只顧個人利益的表現，為她與容天佑的感情線埋下計時炸彈，隨時一觸即發。\n</p>\n<h2>歐瑞偉見何依婷一反常態 溫柔眼神藏伏線</h2>\n<p>劇集尾聲更驚現一大伏線！飾演KC的歐瑞偉在劇中向來只對樊亦敏恭恭敬敬，對其他人則極為嚴肅。然而，當他首次與何依婷飾演的朱圓圓碰面時，竟然全程笑容滿面，態度一百八十度轉變，眼神更流露出罕見的溫柔與欣賞之情。KC這突如其來的反常態度，不禁令觀眾猜測他與朱圓圓背後是否隱藏著不為人知的秘密關係，為劇情增添更多懸念。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議劇情反轉：霸道總裁變小朋友</h2>\n<p>劇集播出後，容天佑的「少爺仔」演出引起網民熱烈討論，輿論相當熱鬧。有網民笑指：「平時睇佢做霸道總裁好型，點知原來係個未大透嘅小朋友！」亦有人覺得角色真實：「呢啲富二代脾氣真係咁，一唔順意就發癲。」不過有觀眾更關心新伏線：「KC個眼神唔對路喎，同圓圓肯定有啲嘢！」更有網民期待：「想睇高冠一知道圓圓同KC有關係之後會有咩反應，肯定仲爆！」\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_16746805386aeabea8bfd3e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_16746805386aeabea8bfd3e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_14888373336aeabead4aad5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_14888373336aeabead4aad5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_2115856676aeabeb0a6f65.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_2115856676aeabeb0a6f65.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_3806836756aeabeb3d6abe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_3806836756aeabeb3d6abe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_4720768776aeabeb725d0d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_4720768776aeabeb725d0d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_21366507926aeabebb2777d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_21366507926aeabebb2777d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_17217028766aeabebdd72a9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_17217028766aeabebdd72a9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_5621872296aeabec0ec272.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_5621872296aeabec0ec272.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_10642665856aeabec450ccb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_10642665856aeabec450ccb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_10804319766aeabec7c2b86.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_10804319766aeabec7c2b86.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_11614059906aeabed1aeca6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_11614059906aeabed1aeca6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_18114913426aeabed509da6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_18114913426aeabed509da6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bd%95%e4%be%9d%e5%a9%b7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">何依婷</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%ae%b9%e5%a4%a9%e4%bd%91/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容天佑</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%84%9b%e5%9b%9e%e5%ae%b6%e4%b9%8b%e4%b8%89%e4%bb%a3%e5%90%8c%e7%b3%96/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">愛回家之三代同糖</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3535750\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 4 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T14:25:47.859159+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1405,"images":12,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T13:00:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:58.497769+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:18:44.097656+00:00","content_hash":"9e8f0109d3768330c66ceababd7b08f526bf9dfacdc3196017397862e5b92c15","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}